Source
------
PubChem BioAssay (https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/), AID 720635 — "qHTS assay
for small molecule disruptors of the mitochondrial membrane potential",
deposited by the NCATS/NIEHS/EPA/FDA Tox21 programme. Retrieved 2026-09-01 via
the PUG-REST concise assay endpoint.

Derivation
----------
Rows the assay called Active or Inactive were kept and rows it called
Inconclusive were dropped; compound identifiers were resolved to isomeric
SMILES through the PubChem compound property endpoint; structures were
standardised (normalise, largest fragment, neutralise) and collapsed to one row
per InChIKey by majority call, with ties dropped. Only the InChIKey,
standardised SMILES, binary label, median reported potency and record counts
are retained.

